{"product_id":"the-male-lead-is-mine-vol-1-novel","title":"The Male Lead Is Mine Vol. 1 (novel)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Male Lead Is Mine, one of the most popular Korean novels, is now available to read officially in English. The Male Lead is Mine is a slice of life and heartwarming medieval fantasy of a woman lacking grand ambition and only wishes to live a quiet and peaceful life with the male lead, the man whom she had fallen in love with.The story tells the life of a modern-day woman who reincarnates in a fantasy novel as Aris Horissen, the novel’s supporting character destined to suffer. She wasn’t sure what had happened. She was just reading a book that suddenly piqued her interest. Before closing it, she ended up pitying Aris, the daughter of the marquis who refused to marry the male lead and ran away from home; Aris met a wicked man in the streets and suffered severe physical and emotional distress, leading to her bitter ending. The modern-day woman felt sympathy for Aris as she fell asleep thinking about how Aris could have avoided her bitter ending if she hadn’t been stubborn to the very end.When she awoke, she had become Aris Horissen herself. Realizing the bitter ending that awaits her, she decides to change the future and snatches the male lead for herself.According to the original novel, it would take two-and-a-half years for them to meet, but she couldn’t wait that long. She’ll have to make the first move. With that thought in mind, she decides to write him a letter. There was no time to waste, after all; she’ll make sure that the sweet and caring male lead is hersWHAT OTHERS ARE SAYING“The love story is romantic, the heroine much more intelligent than your average isekai protagonist (and knowing her past life makes this one make sense).” — Rebecca“I couldn’t put it down. It’s an interesting slice of life story that explores the day-to-day life of an aristocratic woman who lacks ambitions and only wishes to live a lazy life with her male lead. There’s magic in the world, but it isn’t the main focus of the book. This book is for those who love to read isekai novels, but wants to take a break from all the action and adventure.” — Lawrence\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 203\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Kkamang Kkamang\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781954707238\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 220\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45413377015961,"sku":"Manga-A-39781954707238","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68302f08e446c-The-Male-Lead-Is-Mine-Vol-1-novel-_1.jpg?v=1748277012","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-male-lead-is-mine-vol-1-novel","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}